# A repeating alert: the transition's notification, then each repeat's entry is sent, saved and waited for inside
# the pass that makes it; its duration argument is the entry's duration while raised; the CLEAR after the repeats.
database real
rules tests/corpus/notify/repeat.conf
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.n v 70
clock 1
pass 1
clock 2
pass 2
clock 3
pass 3
clock 4
pass 4
clock 5
pass 5
var loop.n v 95
clock 6
pass 6
clock 7
pass 7
clock 8
pass 8
var loop.n v 10
clock 9
pass 9
clock 10
pass 10
clock 11
alarm-log 0
